              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku izithunywa ezilesiqubu zizasuka kimi ukwesabisa amaEtiyopiya angethuswanga lutho, ehlelwe lusizi ngalolosuku lokuchitheka kwamaGibithe, ngoba usuku luyeza.",
          "type": "text",
